OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for sex with dead woman
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man has been jailed for having sex
OL,6,Fwith a dead body.
OL,8,FStephen Sellars, 62, of Hibaldstow,
OL,9,FNorth Lincolnshire, was interrupted by
OL,10,Fthe woman's son and nephew as he
OL,11,Fcarried out the act in her home.
OL,13,FOn Friday, Sellars was sentenced to 16
OL,14,Fmonths' imprisonment at Hull Crown
OL,15,FCourt. He pleaded guilty to the offence
OL,16,Fof sexual penetration of a corpse at an
OL,17,Fearlier hearing.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
