OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for sex with dead woman
OL,4,
OL,5,FIn a statement read to the court, the
OL,6,Fvictim's son said the incident had a
OL,7,F"massive impact" on him and described
OL,8,Fthe offence as "unimaginable" and that
OL,9,F"nothing could ever justify it".
